  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The failure analysis functional testing verified the limit switch malfunction. The switch cam required significantly more force to move than new switches. Only a small amount of grease was found on the internal components and significant wear was found on the components due to lack of lubrication. The shaft O-ring was intact, but severely hardened/embrittled due to aging.",
