  "notes": "Official cause code is TBD/provisional in FORM-366 fields despite a clear proximate cause narrative (dried-out lubricant/aging); per rule 4 the code and category are copied verbatim, with provisional=true. Event is a past-inoperability discovery: failure occurred 6/13/2020, discovered/reported after failure analysis completed 3/24/2021. Redundant B2 channels for RPS and EOC-RPT remained operable throughout, so no BACKED_UP_BY system nodes were created since these are internal redundant channels of the same logic systems, not separate backup systems that meet the modeling bar for a System node; RPS/EOC-RPT are modeled as involved systems only. TSV-4 modeled as Component per explicit PART_OF relationship stated in narrative (limit switch is limit switch for TSV-4)."
